message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Ablating Persistent Structured State Collapses a Weak-Model Scaffolding Harness: A Seed-Matched Component Study"
authors:
  - family-names: Pierce
    given-names: Clayton
    email: bamer78@gmail.com
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
